<<
/Title (Theft of credit card data is one of the most feared occurrences on the Internet. Fear that credit card information will be stolen prevents users from making online purchases in many cases. Online merchants use a variety of techniques to combat credit card fraud, including using automated fraud detection tools, manually reviewing orders, rejection of suspect orders, and requiring additional levels of security such as e-mail address, zip code, and CVV security codes.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1767 0 R
>>
